### =========================================================================
### GO REST API STARTER KIT - HTTP REQUEST COLLECTION (REST CLIENT)
### Auth (JWT + RTR), User Management, & Content Modules
### =========================================================================

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080

# Masukkan access token yang didapat dari respons login / register / refresh:
@accessToken = 
@refreshToken = 

# Ganti dengan ULID riil saat melakukan pengujian detail/update/delete:
@samplePostId = 01ARZ3NDEKTSV4RRFFQ69G5FAV
@sampleCategoryId = 01ARZ3NDEKTSV4RRFFQ69G5FC1


### =========================================================================
### 1. AUTENTIKASI (JWT + REFRESH TOKEN ROTATION)
### =========================================================================

### 1.1 Register Akun Baru
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "johndoe",
  "email": "john@example.com",
  "password": "password123",
  "full_name": "John Doe"
}

### 1.2 Login Akun (Admin / User)
# Menghasilkan JWT access_token dan refresh_token, serta memasang HTTP-only cookie
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@mmdbconnect.com",
  "password": "adminpassword123"
}

### 1.3 Refresh Token (Refresh Token Rotation - RTR)
# Dapat dikirim melalui body JSON, cookie HTTP-only otomatis, atau header X-Refresh-Token
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/refresh
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refresh_token": "{{refreshToken}}"
}

### 1.4 Logout (Mencabut Sesi & Hapus Cookie)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/logout
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refresh_token": "{{refreshToken}}"
}

### 1.5 Ganti Password Akun
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/change-password
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "old_password": "adminpassword123",
  "new_password": "newadminpassword123"
}


### =========================================================================
### 2. USER MANAGEMENT (/api/v1/users)
### =========================================================================

### 2.1 Ambil Data Profil Sendiri (/me)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/users/me
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 2.2 Perbarui Informasi Profil
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/users/profile
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "full_name": "Mochammad Bagas Pratama",
  "bio": "Software Engineer & Backend Enthusiast",
  "phone_number": "081234567890"
}

### 2.3 Ganti Username
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/users/username
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "bagaspratama"
}

### 2.4 Cek Status Akun & Verifikasi Email
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/users/status
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 2.5 Hapus Avatar
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/users/avatar
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}


### =========================================================================
### 3. KONTEN PUBLIK (Read-Only)
### =========================================================================

### 3.1 Daftar Konten Published
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/posts

### 3.2 Filter Konten (Type, Tag, Featured, Pagination)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/posts?type=article&tag=Go&featured=true&page=1&limit=5

### 3.3 Detail Konten Berdasarkan Slug (Increment Views)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/posts/building-rest-apis-with-go

### 3.4 Daftar Semua Kategori Publik
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/categories

### 3.5 Konten Berdasarkan Slug Kategori
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/categories/tutorials-tech/posts

### 3.6 URL Aliases Ramah SEO
GET {{baseUrl}}/articles/building-rest-apis-with-go

GET {{baseUrl}}/blog/my-development-journey

GET {{baseUrl}}/journal/rust-vs-go-file-hashing


### =========================================================================
### 4. ADMIN: MANAJEMEN KONTEN & KATEGORI (Role: Admin)
### =========================================================================

### 4.1 Daftar Seluruh Konten (Draft & Published)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/posts
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 4.2 Buat Konten Baru (ULID Otomatis)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/posts
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "type": "article",
  "title": "Optimasi Query Database di Go Starter Kit",
  "excerpt": "Panduan praktis pembuatan index, connection pool, dan SQLC.",
  "content": "# Optimasi Query Database\n\nMySQL 8.0 dan Go menyediakan throughput tinggi...",
  "category_id": "{{sampleCategoryId}}",
  "tags": ["Go", "MySQL", "Database"],
  "meta_title": "Optimasi Database - Go Starter Kit",
  "meta_description": "Praktik terbaik mengoptimalkan query MySQL pada Go REST API.",
  "is_featured": true,
  "status": "published"
}

### 4.3 Detail Konten Berdasarkan ULID
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/posts/{{samplePostId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 4.4 Perbarui Konten Berdasarkan ULID
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/posts/{{samplePostId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "type": "article",
  "title": "Building REST APIs with Go & Chi (Revisi)",
  "slug": "building-rest-apis-with-go",
  "excerpt": "Panduan membangun RESTful API dengan Go, Chi, ULID, dan JWT.",
  "content": "# Building REST APIs with Go\n\nVersi revisi dengan arsitektur JWT RTR dan ULID...",
  "category_id": "{{sampleCategoryId}}",
  "tags": ["Go", "Chi", "REST API", "Starter Kit"],
  "is_featured": true,
  "status": "published"
}

### 4.5 Hapus Konten Berdasarkan ULID
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/posts/{{samplePostId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 4.6 Daftar Seluruh Kategori
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/categories
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 4.7 Buat Kategori Baru
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/categories
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Cloud & DevOps",
  "slug": "cloud-devops"
}

### 4.8 Perbarui Kategori Berdasarkan ULID
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/categories/{{sampleCategoryId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Cloud Architecture & DevOps",
  "slug": "cloud-architecture-devops"
}

### 4.9 Hapus Kategori Berdasarkan ULID
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/categories/{{sampleCategoryId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
